          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kusakekubonyera kumoni fwana ingi iwachilo, angu kilambo chingi chifwananagha na kilambo chiko aighu mlungunyi, angu chiko ndoenyi aisi, angu machinyi ghiko ndoenyi nakosi;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.4",
