          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kusakejighora duu irina ja BWANA Mlungu wako, angu Mlungu ndechaalegha kumtalia makosa, uo ughoragha irina jake duu.",
